  "title": { "en": "Travel", "uz": "Sayohat", "ru": "Путешествия", "tr": "Seyahat" },
  "goal": {
    "en": "Talk about travel plans and transport, and manage at the airport and the hotel.",
    "uz": "Sayohat rejalari va transport haqida gapiring, aeroport va mehmonxonada muloqot qiling.",
    "ru": "Расскажите о планах на поездку и о транспорте, объяснитесь в аэропорту и в гостинице.",
    "tr": "Seyahat planlarından ve ulaşımdan bahset, havalimanında ve otelde derdini anlat."
  },
  "guide": "aero",
  "color": "#EA580C",
  "tip": {
    "title": { "en": "going to + verb, by + transport", "uz": "going to + fe'l, by + transport", "ru": "going to + глагол, by + транспорт", "tr": "going to + fiil, by + taşıt" },
    "body": {
      "en": "For a plan, use am / is / are + going to + verb: I am going to visit London. The verb after \"going to\" never changes. For a question, put am / is / are first: Are you going to travel? For transport use \"by\" with no article: by train, by plane, by bus.",
      "uz": "Reja yoki niyat haqida gapirganda am / is / are + going to + fe'l ishlatiladi: I am going to visit London. Bu o'zbekchadagi \"-moqchi\" qo'shimchasiga to'g'ri keladi: bormoqchiman. \"Going to\" dan keyingi fe'l o'zgarmaydi. Savolda am / is / are oldinga chiqadi: Are you going to travel? Transport uchun artiklsiz \"by\" ishlatiladi: by train (poyezdda), by plane (samolyotda).",
      "ru": "Чтобы сказать о планах, используйте am / is / are + going to + глагол: I am going to visit London (Я собираюсь посетить Лондон). Глагол после \"going to\" не меняется. В вопросе am / is / are ставится первым: Are you going to travel? Транспорт называют с \"by\" и без артикля: by train (на поезде), by plane (на самолёте).",
      "tr": "Bir plandan ya da niyetten söz ederken am / is / are + going to + fiil kullanılır: I am going to visit London. Türkçedeki \"-ecek / -acak\" ekine benzer: ziyaret edeceğim. \"Going to\"dan sonraki fiil değişmez. Soruda am / is / are başa gelir: Are you going to travel? Taşıtlar için artikelsiz \"by\" kullanılır: by train (trenle), by plane (uçakla)."
    },
    "examples": [
      { "en": "I am going to visit London.", "native": { "uz": "Men Londonni borib ko'rmoqchiman.", "ru": "Я собираюсь посетить Лондон.", "tr": "Londra'yı ziyaret edeceğim." } },
      { "en": "We travel by train.", "native": { "uz": "Biz poyezdda sayohat qilamiz.", "ru": "Мы путешествуем на поезде.", "tr": "Biz trenle seyahat ediyoruz." } },
      { "en": "Are you going to travel abroad?", "native": { "uz": "Sen chet elga sayohat qilmoqchimisan?", "ru": "Ты собираешься путешествовать за границей?", "tr": "Yurt dışına seyahat edecek misin?" } }
    ]
  },
